<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Konsolidacni plans bond issue,Komercni lead.</title>
<headline>Czech Konsolidacni plans bond issue,Komercni lead.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech state-owned Konsolidacni Banka a.s. said on Wednesday that it planned a domestic bond issued lead-managed by Prague-based Komercni Banka probably in April.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be most likely in April,&quot; Mario Zubrik, who manages primary issues for the state's debt factoring bank, told Reuters.</p>
</text>
